>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `set_unsafe_solvers`

``` hol4
simpLib.set_unsafe_solvers : Traverse.ssolver list -> simpset -> simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Replaces the unsafe solvers of a simpset.

`set_unsafe_solvers solvers ss` is `ss` with `solvers` as its unsafe
solvers, keeping only the first of several solvers with the same name.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val decide = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE} : Traverse.ssolver;
>>_ val ss = simpLib.add_unsafe_solver decide bool_ss;
>>+ SIMP_CONV (simpLib.set_unsafe_solvers [] ss)
      [arithmeticTheory.LESS_MOD] “x MOD (x + 1)”;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpLib.set_safe_solvers`](#simpLib.set_safe_solvers).
